{"4116240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Runesmith", "steam_appid": 4116240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/6ed2a47163b1b72ba07d96dd1d267235.avif?t=1787917277\" width=442 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FALLEN GOD: S</strong>tep into a stylized open world shaped by the remnants of ancient gods. Once a divine being yourself, you were cast down to the mortal realm — punished for breaking the ancient order. Now, wandering across frozen glaciers, lush meadows, and endless deserts, you seek the knowledge of runecraft to reclaim your place among the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.poster.avif?t=1787917277\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.webm?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.mp4?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE, HUNT, FARM AND CRAFT:</strong> This open world is filled with uncharted lands, hidden ruins, and forgotten temples waiting to be uncovered. From icy peaks to sunburned deserts, every region holds new resources, creatures, and mysteries to discover. Exploration is the key to survival — the more you venture, the more you learn about the world once ruled by gods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you’ll cultivate rare seeds and ancient crops to sustain yourself, hunt strange beasts and mythical creatures for valuable materials, and mine precious stones scattered across the lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.poster.avif?t=1787917277\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.webm?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.mp4?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/ff24eee85f58395f5b63a02c11daf84e.avif?t=1787917277\" width=442 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT RUNES AND EARN THE GODS' FAVOR:</strong> The gods still watch from above. To regain their favor, you’ll complete divine tasks and trials sent by Ares, Hades, Hermes, Hephaestus, Demeter, and Artemis — each testing a different aspect of your strength. Throughout your journey, you’ll gather precious resources and forge hundreds of unique runes, each enhancing your magic, skill, and might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune carries the blessing of a different god, granting specialized powers that shape your playstyle. Whether you’re a miner seeking rare stones under ancient skies, a hunter stalking mythical beasts, or an explorer charting lost ruins, the path to mastery is yours to forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.poster.avif?t=1787917277\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.webm?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.mp4?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a true Runesmith. Forge your destiny — and reclaim your lost glory among the gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/d69e9f866895a5b7c4452dfe35fddaf3.avif?t=1787917277\" width=442 height=100 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/6ed2a47163b1b72ba07d96dd1d267235.avif?t=1787917277\" width=442 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FALLEN GOD: S</strong>tep into a stylized open world shaped by the remnants of ancient gods. Once a divine being yourself, you were cast down to the mortal realm — punished for breaking the ancient order. Now, wandering across frozen glaciers, lush meadows, and endless deserts, you seek the knowledge of runecraft to reclaim your place among the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.poster.avif?t=1787917277\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.webm?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.mp4?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE, HUNT, FARM AND CRAFT:</strong> This open world is filled with uncharted lands, hidden ruins, and forgotten temples waiting to be uncovered. From icy peaks to sunburned deserts, every region holds new resources, creatures, and mysteries to discover. Exploration is the key to survival — the more you venture, the more you learn about the world once ruled by gods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you’ll cultivate rare seeds and ancient crops to sustain yourself, hunt strange beasts and mythical creatures for valuable materials, and mine precious stones scattered across the lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.poster.avif?t=1787917277\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.webm?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.mp4?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/ff24eee85f58395f5b63a02c11daf84e.avif?t=1787917277\" width=442 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT RUNES AND EARN THE GODS' FAVOR:</strong> The gods still watch from above. To regain their favor, you’ll complete divine tasks and trials sent by Ares, Hades, Hermes, Hephaestus, Demeter, and Artemis — each testing a different aspect of your strength. Throughout your journey, you’ll gather precious resources and forge hundreds of unique runes, each enhancing your magic, skill, and might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune carries the blessing of a different god, granting specialized powers that shape your playstyle. Whether you’re a miner seeking rare stones under ancient skies, a hunter stalking mythical beasts, or an explorer charting lost ruins, the path to mastery is yours to forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.poster.avif?t=1787917277\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.webm?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.mp4?t=1787917277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a true Runesmith. Forge your destiny — and reclaim your lost glory among the gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/d69e9f866895a5b7c4452dfe35fddaf3.avif?t=1787917277\" width=442 height=100 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore ancient lands, gather rare materials, and forge pow